{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":20,"count":41,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L08-2-20\",\"樓梯\",\"樓梯\",\"楼梯\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要坐電梯，不要走樓梯。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào zuò diàntī, bù yào zǒu lóutī.","english":"I want to take the elevator, not walk the stairs.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-20","sourceFront":"樓梯","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了避免兒童發生意外，家長在樓梯邊裝了安全網。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-25","sourceFront":"網","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公寓的電梯修復中，請大家改走樓梯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-21","sourceFront":"修復","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"樓(floor) + 梯(ladder): a ladder between floors → stairs."},{"key":"[\"B1L08-3-06\",\"杂志\",\"雜誌\",\"杂志\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"很多年輕男生愛在書店看汽車雜誌，汽車很貴，他們不一定可以買新車，可是都看得很開心。","pinyin":"Hěn duō niánqīng nánshēng ài zài shūdiàn kàn qìchē zázhì, qìchē hěn guì, tāmen bù yídìng kěyǐ mǎi xīn chē, kěshì dōu kàn de hěn kāixīn.","english":"Many young men like to read car magazines at bookstores. Cars are expensive and they don’t usually have the money to buy new ones; however, they are very happy just by reading those magazines.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-3-02\",\"開始\",\"開始\",\"开始\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"最近感冒的人很多，我的同學國安也感冒了，今天開始發燒了。","pinyin":"Zuìjìn gǎnmào de rén hěn duō, wǒ de tóngxué Guó'ān yě gǎnmào le, jīntiān kāishǐ fāshāo le.","english":"Many people got colds lately. My classmate, Guoan, got a cold, too. He started to have a fever today.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"You open (開) the curtain, and the show begins (始): 開始 is 'to start'."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-3-15\",\"工厂\",\"工廠\",\"工厂\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"聽說這家工廠的工人都很辛苦，可是老闆給的錢不多。","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè jiā gōngchǎng de gōngrén dōu hěn xīnkǔ, kěshì lǎobǎn gěi de qián bù duō.","english":"I heard that the workers at this factory all work very hard, but the money the boss gives is not much.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-16","sourceFront":"工人","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"老闆今天帶我去參觀了一家工廠。","pinyin":"Lǎobǎn jīntiān dài wǒ qù cānguān le yì jiā gōngchǎng.","english":"The boss took me to visit a factory today.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-1-08","sourceFront":"參觀","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠的工作很辛苦，可是錢很多，所以很多人願意做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-41","sourceFront":"願意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？看起來很不開心的樣子。 B:唉！工廠發生問題，今天又得加班處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-40","sourceFront":"唉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小龍受不了在那個又熱又髒的工廠工作，只做了三天就離開了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-27","sourceFront":"受不了","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠生產的皮鞋、皮帶，不但品質好，價錢也不貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-16","sourceFront":"生產","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的水災不僅淹了整條街，好幾家工廠也因為淹水沒辦法生產，真是太糟了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-29","sourceFront":"水災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個工人使用工廠的機器時，不小心發生了意外，流了很多血。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-37","sourceFront":"血","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠自從改善了設備以後，生產速度就一天比一天快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-01","sourceFront":"自從","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠的設備及員工都嚴重缺乏，哪裡有辦法進一步發展？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-39","sourceFront":"哪裡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"家中的廢車可送到汽車修理工廠回收，多多少少能賣點錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-39","sourceFront":"廢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"工廠排水系統得設計好，以免汙染自然環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-48","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠排出的廢氣很毒，附近已經有不少民眾生病了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-52","sourceFront":"毒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你既然把工廠交給他，就得放手讓他去管理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-01","sourceFront":"放手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"新員工在經過專門的訓練後，都已能使用工廠各種生產機器。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-04","sourceFront":"專門","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠排出的黑煙不只氣味難聞，更可怕的是可能對肺部造成傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-14","sourceFront":"煙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們特地到當地的滑雪用品工廠參觀，並進行技術交流。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-16","sourceFront":"技術","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自動化工廠不僅使生產速度更快，同時也能保證產品品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-46","sourceFront":"自動化","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家工廠使用的大型機械全都是淺綠色的，看起來很有特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-02","sourceFront":"機械","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她在電子工廠上班，難怪拆機器的技術非常熟練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-09","sourceFront":"熟練","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣企業到發展中國家設立工廠，是因為當地的人工便宜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-34","sourceFront":"人工","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在抗議新建工廠的活動中，當地的環保團體聯合起來表達他們的需求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-38","sourceFront":"聯合","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家工廠奪下了著名品牌產品的製造機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-03","sourceFront":"奪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-16\",\"见\",\"見\",\"见\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"好，明天見。","pinyin":"Hǎo, míngtiān jiàn.","english":"Okay, see you tomorrow.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-10\",\"虎\",\"虎/老虎\",\"虎/老虎\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"燈籠上的小老虎好可愛。","pinyin":"Dēnglóng shàng de xiǎo lǎohǔ hǎo kě'ài.","english":"The little tiger on the lantern is so lovely.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這是我朋友做的，因為他屬虎。妳知道十二生肖嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè shì wǒ péngyou zuò de, yīnwèi tā shǔ hǔ. Nǐ zhīdào shí'èr shēngxiào ma?","english":"This is the lantern that my friend made because his Chinese zodiac animal sign is tiger. Do you know the Chinese animal zodiac?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 虍(tiger) pelt rests over a 儿(person) → one fierce 虎(tiger)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-08\",\"药房\",\"藥房\",\"药房\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的頭很疼，你可以幫我去藥房買藥嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-08","sourceFront":"藥房","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-10\",\"殺\",\"殺\",\"杀\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在夜市買東西的時候，有些人會跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-10","sourceFront":"殺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個壞人殺了人，他知道自己錯了，到教堂去請求上帝原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-22","sourceFront":"請求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那件名牌長裙才兩千元而已，用不著跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-20","sourceFront":"而已","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自殺或許能令個人不再受到痛苦，但卻把痛苦留給了身邊的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-04","sourceFront":"自殺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-31\",\"芒果冰\",\"芒果冰\",\"芒果冰\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"夏天的時候，芒果冰、西瓜汁的生意好得不得了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-19","sourceFront":"生意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你說你昨天吃了五盤芒果冰，太誇張了吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-14","sourceFront":"誇張","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的芒果冰好吃得沒話說，連吃過的外國人也十分滿意","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-26\",\"花\",\"花\",\"花\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她很喜歡花，你可以送她一些漂亮的花。","pinyin":"Tā hěn xǐhuān huā, nǐ kěyǐ sòng tā yìxiē piàoliàng de huā.","english":"She likes flowers very much. You can give her some beautiful flowers.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-14","sourceFront":"可以","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"窗戶前面有很多花，很漂亮。","pinyin":"Chuānghù qiánmiàn yǒu hěn duō huā, hěn piàoliàng.","english":"There are many flowers in front of the window. It’s very beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-05","sourceFront":"窗戶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這朵花很好看。","pinyin":"Zhè duǒ huā hěn hǎokàn.","english":"This flower is beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-20","sourceFront":"好看","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"紅色的花、白色的花都很漂亮。","pinyin":"Hóngsè de huā, báisè de huā, dōu hěn piàoliang.","english":"Red and white flowers are both beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-19","sourceFront":"都","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他送我花和一本書。","pinyin":"Tā sòng wǒ huā hé yì běn shū.","english":"He gave me flowers and a book as presents.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-15","sourceFront":"和","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我送媽媽一朵花。","pinyin":"Wǒ sòng māma yì duǒ huā.","english":"I gave mom a flower.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-13","sourceFront":"花","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我想買一些花和一個大蛋糕。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng mǎi yìxiē huā hé yí ge dà dàngāo.","english":"I would like to buy her some flowers and a big cake.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-01","sourceFront":"買","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) transforms with 化(change) into a 花(flower)."},{"key":"[\"B2L09-2-15\",\"语法\",\"語法\",\"语法\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我覺得「把」的語法很難，造句的時候常弄錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-15","sourceFront":"語法","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這堂語法課的內容比較難，學生有任何問題都可以舉手請教老師。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-27","sourceFront":"請教","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"顏教授對漢語語法有很深入的研究，難怪他的語法課那麼受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-19","sourceFront":"深入","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"(1) 不少外國人說中文不容易學，除了漢字難寫，聲調、語法也很難。想把中文學好，總而言之就是多聽、多說、多練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-27","sourceFront":"總而言之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"剛學的詞和語法最好常使用、多複習，如此才能加深記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-16","sourceFront":"加深","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這項語法不太重要，我賭考試一定不會考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-47","sourceFront":"賭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L13-1-24\",\"傳真\",\"傳真\",\"传真\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這份文件很急，請你下班以前傳真給對方公司。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-36","sourceFront":"傳真","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有張紙卡在傳真機裡，你拿得出來嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-38","sourceFront":"卡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-20\",\"感觉\",\"感覺\",\"感觉\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"昨天晚上我發燒，燒到三十九度，那種感覺非常不舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-20","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"林明生躺在草地上看星星，他感覺真輕鬆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-19","sourceFront":"輕鬆","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"第一次約會的時候，林先生感覺(到)自己很緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這棟公寓除了環境不錯，家具還很新，感覺住起來會很舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小時候爺爺常陪我做功課、教我打球和釣魚，現在回想起那段時間，感覺真幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-26","sourceFront":"回想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部電影是用真實故事拍成的，讓觀眾感覺很真實，也很感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-30","sourceFront":"真實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部愛情電影是根據真實故事拍出來的，看過的人都很有感覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-01","sourceFront":"根據","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"彩色照片看起來很真實，不過黑白照片給人的感覺也很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-29","sourceFront":"彩色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的布告上貼著超市打折活動的廣告，感覺真的很怪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-08","sourceFront":"布告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"接觸陌生的事情及環境時，往往令人有點兒不安，這樣的感覺是很自然的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-25","sourceFront":"不安","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天運動過後，喝杯冰冰涼涼的冷飲，感覺很痛快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-24","sourceFront":"冷飲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在戶外的夜景中攝影，以月光當作背景可增加神秘的感覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-24","sourceFront":"月光","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-15\",\"饅頭\",\"饅頭\",\"馒头\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"週末我帶孩子們去鄉下玩，他們餵小羊吃草，拿饅頭給猴子吃，玩得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-20","sourceFront":"餵","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付完學費，我的獎學金只剩下三千塊，這個月只有吃饅頭過日子了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-07","sourceFront":"只有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國南北方的飲食習慣有一些差異，南方人多吃米飯，北方人多吃餃子、饅頭等麵食。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-15","sourceFront":"米飯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 饅(steamed buns) and 頭(the first): 饅頭 means steamed bun."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-18\",\"采用\",\"採用\",\"采用\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"經理這次願意採用新員工的建議，讓我們都嚇了一跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-18","sourceFront":"採用","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"企業為了錄用合適的人才，而採用各式各樣的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-21","sourceFront":"錄用","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次畢業典禮，學校打算採用空拍的方式來拍紀念影片。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-03","sourceFront":"空拍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從採用專家提供的方法後，茶葉的產量已增加百分之五十。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-10","sourceFront":"產量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-2-38\",\"命\",\"命\",\"命\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"不少人相信人的命是被決定的， 誰都改變不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-38","sourceFront":"命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"沒有人知道自己的命能有多長， 所以每天都應該好好過日子","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-38","sourceFront":"命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"醫生的工作是讓病人恢復健康，甚至把寶貴的生命救回來，所以我們應該尊敬醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-37","sourceFront":"生命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"救護車開得很快，因為要救人一命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-18","sourceFront":"救命","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個紀念堂是為了紀念那些為國家犧牲生命的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-04","sourceFront":"為","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"強烈颱風快來了，救災中心對民眾發出警告，為了自己的生命安全，絕對別去海邊","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-20","sourceFront":"警告","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"打仗期間，許多軍人為國家犧牲了寶貴的生命，也給家人留下了痛苦的記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-14","sourceFront":"打仗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人的生命價值都是一樣的，不應該為了自己的利益而犧牲別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"誰都無法告訴你生命的意義是什麼，只能自己去尋找答案。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-07","sourceFront":"無法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"理論上，有空氣、水、食物就可以維持生命，但還是得看實際的情況","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-21","sourceFront":"理論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們無法決定生命的長度，卻能夠決定生活的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-09","sourceFront":"長度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生命就像海洋一樣，只有勇敢的人們才能抵達海的另一邊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-47","sourceFront":"海洋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生命就像一片海洋，有時穩定有時瘋狂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-10","sourceFront":"瘋狂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位母親寧可犧牲自己的生命，也要保護孩子的安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-10","sourceFront":"寧可","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在古代，國王所說的話是絕對的，也是最高的命令。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-34","sourceFront":"命令","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國王命下面的人死，那些人就非死不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-35","sourceFront":"命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是你擔心營養不夠的話，吃點兒維他命對身體健康會有幫助的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-16","sourceFront":"維他命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天光是整理前院的花草樹木就讓我累得要命，只好明天再整理後院了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-44","sourceFront":"要命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車時不闖紅燈，是為了自己和別人的生命安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-24","sourceFront":"闖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過這次手術，得了重病的嬰兒終於順利地保住了生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-32","sourceFront":"保","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在歷史上，每次革命都對社會造成非常大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-02","sourceFront":"革命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"戰爭雖然勝利了，這個國家卻也失去了許多寶貴的生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-23","sourceFront":"勝利","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他看了歷史電影後，就非常崇拜戰爭中的革命英雄。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-30","sourceFront":"英雄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她推動學習革命，讓學生主動參與規劃課程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-01","sourceFront":"推動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生命中每一刻都很珍貴，隨時多用點心、多付出，就能令人生更美好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-08","sourceFront":"刻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"關於生命的意義，每個人的想法都不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-09","sourceFront":"關於","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不小心摔壞了新買的手機，因此難過得要命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-14","sourceFront":"摔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 亼(gather) of people bow low in 叩(kowtow) to ask for a 命(life)."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-20\",\"這下子\",\"這下子\",\"这下子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我沒趕上最後一班公車，這下子只好搭計程車回家了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:我太糊塗了，忘了把變更後的網路銀行密碼記下來。 B:這下子你得親自去銀行處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-26","sourceFront":"變更","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"Given 這(this) situation right 下(below) now with suffix 子(son): 這下子 means now, thus."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-06\",\"蓋\",\"蓋\",\"盖\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"學校蓋了一棟活動中心，學生又多了一個交流、休閒的好場所了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-06","sourceFront":"蓋","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小年的夢想就是蓋一棟土地面積六十坪、三層樓高的房子，讓全家人都住在一起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-08","sourceFront":"面積","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Grass 艹(grass) on a roof covers a house; the 盍(what?) inside asks why. → 蓋(build a house)."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-12\",\"科學\",\"科學\",\"科学\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有一些研究科學的人，對不科學、無法合理解釋的現象都不太相信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-12","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"上帝是不是存在，這是屬於宗教領域的問題，科學家的解釋不一定是正確的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-15","sourceFront":"領域","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"科學家早就證明了氣溫的變化對農業生產有不好的影響，可是到目前還找不到解決的好辦法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-22","sourceFront":"證明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"這兩家公司在科技方面合作了很多年，也在科學雜誌上發表了共同的研究成果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-20","sourceFront":"共同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"著名的科學家愛因斯坦（ Àiyīnsītǎn, Albert Einstein）發明了相對論（Theory of Relativity），這個理論對後來的科學研究產生了重大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-21","sourceFront":"理論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"月亮上面沒有動物，這是1969年科學的新發現。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-21","sourceFront":"發現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"語言和科學我都很喜歡。","pinyin":"Yǔyán hé kēxué wǒ dōu hěn xǐhuan.","english":"I like both language and science.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-3-03","sourceFront":"科學","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"根據目前科學研究的資料，女性與男性在能力、態度和行為等方面的差異都非常小。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-41","sourceFront":"男性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路教授最近發表的這套跟人體大腦有關的理論，令其他科學家很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-45","sourceFront":"套","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家在他的時代所努力的結果，都可能會在未來開花結果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-31","sourceFront":"結果","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對科學家或藝術家來說，提供他們一個不受限制的工作環境是很重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-15","sourceFront":"限制","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天的自然科學課程所介紹的主題是月球的構造。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-25","sourceFront":"月球","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"科學 means science: 科(branch) + 學(study) → studying nature branch by branch."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-28\",\"帳單\",\"帳單\",\"帐单\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"收到帳單的時候得準時去繳費，以免超過時間後得繳更多錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-28","sourceFront":"帳單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"吃完飯到櫃臺結帳前，應該先看清楚帳單有沒有錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-29","sourceFront":"結帳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的帳單已經加了服務費了，你不必再給小費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-04","sourceFront":"小費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-07\",\"做客\",\"做客/作客\",\"做客/作客\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"到別人家做客時不能太隨便，以免發生不愉快的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-07","sourceFront":"做客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-1-25\",\"棒子\",\"棒子\",\"棒子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"練習八百公尺跑步時，教練除了要大家記得自己是跑第幾棒的，並且提醒我們把棒子拿好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-26","sourceFront":"棒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-45\",\"強迫\",\"強迫\",\"强迫\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"除非別人願意，否則你不該強迫其他人全按你的意見做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-45","sourceFront":"強迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-43\",\"一旁\",\"一旁\",\"一旁\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"坐火車時，一旁的旅客不停地講電話，吵得我受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-43","sourceFront":"一旁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他失業了，但妻子三人卻仍在一旁支持著他，讓他安心了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-22","sourceFront":"妻子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-25\",\"高度\",\"高度\",\"高度\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"使用高度技術製造出來的工業生產機器，操作起來往往更有效率。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-25","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這座橋對車子的高度有限制，開大車的人要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-11","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"什\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) holds 十(ten) fingers up in question → 什(what)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"分鐘\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"分(divide) + 鐘(clock) → the clock's divisions are minutes."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"可惡\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 可(can) and 惡(bad): 可惡 means detestable, hateful."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"品味\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 品(article) and 味(taste): 品味 means taste or style."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"堅強\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 堅(hard) and 強(strong): 堅強 means mentally strong."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"尤其\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 尤(especially) and 其(his): 尤其 means especially."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"投資\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 投(pitch) and 資(wealth): 投資 means invest."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"激\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Splashing 氵(water) on the 敫(ancient instrument) arouses its sound → 激(arouse)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"狀\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 爿(split wood) plank lies beside the faithful 犬(dog) resting in its peaceful condition → 狀(state)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"祝福\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 祝(wish) and 福(happiness): 祝福 means wish happiness to."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"秀\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A ripe stalk of golden 禾(grain) curves gracefully while 乃(nǎi) bends like a slender stem with graceful 秀(elegant) beauty."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"節\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 竹(bamboo) flute leans on the 即(prompt) of a doorway → 節(festival)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"綠色\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"綠(green) + 色(color) → green."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"表示\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Presenting an outward 表(form) to 示(show) your true intentions: 表示 means express, to show."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"親眼\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 親(relatives) and 眼(glance): 親眼 means with one's own eyes."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"觀\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 雚(heron) takes to the 見(see) tower → here to 觀(observe) the town."}]}
